{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34273","headline":"小鸡山樵人歌 · 陆龟蒙","name":"小鸡山樵人歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长其船兮利其斧，输予薪兮勿予侮。\n田予登兮谷予庾，突晨烟兮蓬缕缕。\n窗有明兮编有古，饱而安兮惟编是伍，时不用兮吾无汝抚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}